 unravel ghostly mysteries—and maybe his own past.","tagline":"WILL HIS RETURN BRING MORE CHAOS OR AT LAST PEACE INTO THE WORLD?"},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"魔道祖师","overview":"温氏横行，生灵涂炭。江湖仙门义士发动“射日之征”，合力讨伐温氏。“夷陵老祖”魏无羡虽在推翻温氏中立下了汗马功劳，却因修非常道且太过强大而遭人忌惮坑害，致万人唾骂，被情同手足的师弟带人端了老巢，身陨形灭。十三年后，魏无羡被人献舍，并再度与姑苏蓝氏蓝忘机、云梦江氏江澄等旧人相遇，前尘谜团未消，江湖疑云再起。而这一切恩怨情仇，都要从他们少年时说起……"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mrvndOpCCoyAQ0BXTdQsii7AwG6.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mrvndOpCCoyAQ0BXTdQsii7AwG6.png","language":"en","width":2630,"height":1240},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5TCHOWXSW9qWAmaOYjJOMzglC0L.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5TCHOWXSW9qWAmaOYjJOMzglC0L.png","language":"zh","width":840,"height":395},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6TZlAXSpEe4ggnebF61vaVN2JFF.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6TZlAXSpEe4ggnebF61vaVN2JFF.png","language":"zh","width":759,"height":360}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/atEXUa6I6w7IZ1TWKFloysoL4hS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/atEXUa6I6w7IZ1TWKFloysoL4hS.jpg","language":"en","width":1500,"height":2250},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7YWFoE542on8Cjzdbyf3kUzmt8v.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7YWFoE542on8Cjzdbyf3kUzmt8v.jpg","language":"en","width":770,"height":1155},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yYWnI20FjtCShXTnd7lqsfQQUKv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yYWnI20FjtCShXTnd7lqsfQQUKv.jpg","language":"en","width":666,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5dEJiAcCCP8Eulz9PljyM8l55BE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5dEJiAcCCP8Eulz9PljyM8l55BE.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nH9HZrygttwBBSSfWOggUmcYfzj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://i